<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Message Sent - Thank You</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .success-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 90%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .checkmark {
            color: #2F855A;
            font-size: 60px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .success-card h1 {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #1F2937;
        }
        .success-card p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #4b5563;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .warning-box {
            background-color: #FEF2F2;
            border-left: 4px solid #d32f2f;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: left;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .warning-box p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #991B1B;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .home-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #000;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        .home-btn:hover {
            background-color: #333;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="success-card">
        <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
        <h1>Thank You!</h1>
        <p>We have received your message. Our support team is reviewing your request and will get back to you shortly.</p>
        
        <div class="warning-box">
            <p><strong>Important:</strong> Please whitelist our email (<strong>support@fitmoonofficial.com</strong>) and check your SPAM or JUNK folder if you don't hear from us in 24 hours.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="home-btn">Return to Homepage</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
